      <informativeText>Abstract: This is certificate signing request for BATL device which is part of Vehicle Keyless Access. As the generated CSR would be upto 1536 bytes and there is a limitation from BLE SIG and Silicon Labs' stack we are splitting it into 8 blocks of 192 bytes each. This part contains 5th block.</informativeText>
      <value length="192" type="hex" variable_length="true">00</value>
